Apache DataFusion's sqllogictest files

The scripts in this directory are files of Apache DataFusion's
datafusion/sqllogictest/test_files/ at commit
934691e9af8f11bf4b629f21bb17795abfb84d93 (https://github.com/apache/datafusion),
each as it is there but for its header and the condition lines added before its
records (`skipif transformer <id>`, `onlyif datafusion # ...`) and the twins after
some of them; join_part.test is test_files/join.slt.part, which join_only.slt
includes. data/ holds the CSV files they read: aggregate_test_100.csv from Apache
Arrow's arrow-testing (data/csv/, at commit
7df2b70baf4f081ebf8e0c6bd22745cf3cbfd824, DataFusion's testing submodule), and the
others from DataFusion's datafusion/core/tests/data/ at the same commit.

